      ],
      "review_due": "2027-09-01",
      "body": "## 1. Power\n\n- [ ] Switch on [[device:chpl-pdu]] in the vestry cupboard. The receivers and the hearing-assist transmitter come up with it.\n\n## 2. Sound\n\n- [ ] Switch on [[device:chpl-mixer]]; check the main fader is at the tape mark.\n- [ ] Switch on [[device:chpl-amp]] **last**.\n- [ ] Switch on the handheld and the lavalier; check RF on [[device:chpl-wrx-1]] and [[device:chpl-wrx-2]].\n\n## 3. Screen\n\n- [ ] Switch on [[device:chpl-display]] with the remote and pick **HDMI 1** ([[device:chpl-media]]).\n\n## After the service\n\n- [ ] Amp off first, then the mixer, then the PDU.\n",
      "created": "2026-10-01T09:00:00Z",
      "updated": "2026-10-01T09:00:00Z",
      "updated_by": "starter",
      "owner": "starter"
    }
